{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["וְשַׁתִּי — like וְשַׁתְתִּי. And likewise כָּרַתִּי ברית is like כָּרַתְתִּי." "Sea of Reeds — that it is at the beginning of the east of the Land of Israel, as is proven in the section אלה הדברים." "And as far as the sea of the Philistines — that it is in the west, as it is written: ״וּפְלִשְׁתִּים מֵאָחוֹר״." "And from the wilderness — which Israel traveled through from the south." "As far as the river — the Euphrates River in the north. As it is written: ״מִצָּפוֹן תִּפָּתַח הָרָעָה״, for Babylon is in the north."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:42:53.718122424Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}